WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,380 --> 00:00:12,450
you can't kill me

2
00:00:12,450 --> 00:00:14,540
I was sent here by the provincial labor force

3
00:00:14,540 --> 00:00:16,540
It was made very clear on the radio just now

4
00:00:16,540 --> 00:00:20,540
Don't touch that fake skin of yours

5
00:00:20,540 --> 00:00:27,980
No wonder it smells like death

6
00:00:27,980 --> 00:00:30,620
The white-eyed wolf who led Guandong Army back then

7
00:00:30,620 --> 00:00:32,850
Is it your father?

8
00:00:32,850 --> 00:00:37,470
Why did you change your face?

9
00:00:37,470 --> 00:00:42,730
Don't let the dog come

10
00:00:42,730 --> 00:00:43,730
Li Changsheng

11
00:00:43,730 --> 00:00:46,730
I have money, dollars and gold bars

12
00:00:46,730 --> 00:00:48,730
I'll give you whatever you want
